# The Caligrafy application this app calls while it is built: the project's Docker server (php caligrafer.php server
# start). The iOS simulator reaches it at localhost; on the Android emulator the app calls 10.0.2.2 by itself. A real
# phone cannot reach this computer over plain http: test a phone against the site online (.env.production).
VITE_API_ROUTE=http://localhost:8080
